    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just that some of the board members are reading reports saying it actually creates more legal and administrative overhead that eats into margins. if they're looking for a straight answer, is there a definitive way to say whether the ROI is a real thing or if it's just something companies say to look good on paper?",
