    "summary": "The user is asking for a business-oriented perspective on Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion (DEI) initiatives, specifically regarding their impact on ROI. The assistant repeatedly dismisses skeptical viewpoints as \"outdated\" or \"superficial\" and ultimately provides actionable advice on how to frame arguments to favor the pro-DEI position in a board memo.",
